# MLCE_Group_BO_VirtualLab_Improved.py
# Strategy: GP + EI + Kriging Believer + ML-II
#
# Applies best policy from sweep + robustness edits:
#   1) Best policy defaults:
#        - EI_mu_boost with kappa=1.0 for first 2 picks of batch 1
#        - xi amplitude 0.24 with decay -0.05
#   2) xi floor added (0.03) to reduce premature exploitation collapse
#   3) Reduce collapse risk from bad GP fits:
#        - ML-II with small number of random restarts; keep best NLL
#        - safe jitter
#   4) Tie-breaking early:
#        - random among top-K acquisition scores for batch 1 (and optionally batch 2)
#   5) Stronger diversity only in batch 1 (then revert to base)
#
# Runtime:
#   - Runs N_RUNS=30 (as requested)
# =============================================================

